          "value": "<p>The targoyle hurls a ball of tar at a point it can see within 60 feet of itself. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 16 Dexterity, each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centred on the point. <em>Failure:</em> 28 (8d6) Bludgeoning damage, and the creature is coated in tar as if it failed the saving throw against the Targoyle's Tar Splatter trait. <em>Success:</em> Half damage only. <em>Failure or Success:</em> Ground in the area becomes Difficult Terrain for 1 minute.</p>",
